(6665263, 996897, 107506, '<td valign="top">Ah, the age old sport of trampoline twirling time.  Who was it? Barbra Stewart that came in 2nd for the USA when this sport was first included in the Olympics?  Time and time again I urged my parents to allow me to quit school so we could focus on competitive trampoline twirling time, but they kept telling me there isn''t much money to be had.<br/> <br/>By the looks of it: Solid wrist grasp 8.8, big smile 9.2, elevation 6.4, dizziness and focus of twirl I cannot judge by the photo, but I would declare this about at 7.5 tramp twirl. Unfortunately this wouldn''t do well in the tramp twirl time (TTT) comp leagues I used to enter.  You may want to see how well you guys are at TJT (Trampoline Jump Time).  I hear this may be the next sport to hit elementary schools.</td>', 'Ah, the age old sport of trampoline twirling time.  Who was it? Barbra Stewart that came in 2nd for the USA when this sport was first included in the Olympics?  Time and time again I urged my parents to allow me to quit school so we could focus on competitive trampoline twirling time, but they kept telling me there isn''t much money to be had. By the looks of it: Solid wrist grasp 8.8, big smile 9.2, elevation 6.4, dizziness and focus of twirl I cannot judge by the photo, but I would declare this about at 7.5 tramp twirl. Unfortunately this wouldn''t do well in the tramp twirl time (TTT) comp leagues I used to enter.  You may want to see how well you guys are at TJT (Trampoline Jump Time).  I hear this may be the next sport to hit elementary schools.', '2012-02-06 13:14:32.000000', NULL, 1),
(6665298, 996820, 68020, '<td valign="top">nicely done...he needs to move that hand from under his shoulder! :-)</td>', 'nicely done...he needs to move that hand from under his shoulder! :-)', '2012-02-06 13:55:07.000000', NULL, 1),
