(6665547, 996820, 108544, '<td valign="top">Very engaging. I feel like he really wants, actually needs my help. Perhaps I''m his coach, etc....<br/>Nice shot though, truly engaging. Great colour, sharpness, timing, boken, depth of field and comp. Being picky, I would like to see a more level horizon. Being picky...<br/> <br/>Overall an Excellent image!</td>', 'Very engaging. I feel like he really wants, actually needs my help. Perhaps I''m his coach, etc....Nice shot though, truly engaging. Great colour, sharpness, timing, boken, depth of field and comp. Being picky, I would like to see a more level horizon. Being picky... Overall an Excellent image!', '2012-02-06 19:38:21.000000', NULL, 1),
(6665548, 997119, 108544, '<td valign="top">That is so messed up! I love it!<br/>Exposure and processing, very interesting.</td>', 'That is so messed up! I love it!Exposure and processing, very interesting.', '2012-02-06 19:39:54.000000', NULL, 1),
(6665562, 996888, 108544, '<td valign="top">Thank goodness for those knee/shin pads, Ouch!<br/>Great shot though. Timing was perfect! Great use of exposure and shutter speed. <br/>It is so cool, to have the d to shoot talent like this. We are lucky...<br/>Nice work...</td>', 'Thank goodness for those knee/shin pads, Ouch!Great shot though. Timing was perfect! Great use of exposure and shutter speed. It is so cool, to have the d to shoot talent like this. We are lucky...Nice work...', '2012-02-06 19:49:37.000000', NULL, 1),
(6665584, 996846, 108544, '<td valign="top">I like the idea and image overall. But do find the lighting style on her face, a little off. I''m not sure if it''s processing or lighting, But It just has an unnatural, dirty look to it. Giving her a bit of a zombie look. <br/>Still though an excellent concept and image. opportunity</td>', 'I like the idea and image overall. But do find the lighting style on her face, a little off. I''m not sure if it''s processing or lighting, But It just has an unnatural, dirty look to it. Giving her a bit of a zombie look. Still though an excellent concept and image. opportunity', '2012-02-06 20:02:42.000000', NULL, 1),
