(6674572, 997009, 131399, '<td valign="top">Thanks for all the comments!!<br/>I wanted to convey  motion but the fieldof runners was so thick in front of me that pannign didn''t work out too well with too many moving arms and legs, so I just held the camera steady and didn''t pan at all and this was the result.</td>', 'Thanks for all the comments!!I wanted to convey  motion but the fieldof runners was so thick in front of me that pannign didn''t work out too well with too many moving arms and legs, so I just held the camera steady and didn''t pan at all and this was the result.', '2012-02-13 16:29:55.000000', NULL, 0),
