(6676196, 997154, 75713, '<td valign="top">Your first ribbon - amazing it took this long given your level of talent .. but now many will follow - great stopped motion and you did a fantastic job of making the colors in the kids outfit really pop.  Congratulations.<br/><br/><i>Message edited by author 2012-02-15 07:50:35.</i></td>', 'Your first ribbon - amazing it took this long given your level of talent .. but now many will follow - great stopped motion and you did a fantastic job of making the colors in the kids outfit really pop.  Congratulations.', '2012-02-14 11:43:52.000000', '2012-02-15 07:50:35.000000', 0),
(6676504, 997050, 30364, '<td valign="top">Oh! I rarely look at challenges I haven''t entered/voted. So when something good happens I often miss it.  This is something good!  It''s a very fine picture indeed.  I''d have given you a big score and a gushing comment, Robert.  It''s such an unusual, clever photograph, and quite beautiful.  Other-worldly, in a quiet way.  A great thing to remember this special moment by.  Thank you.</td>', 'Oh! I rarely look at challenges I haven''t entered/voted. So when something good happens I often miss it.  This is something good!  It''s a very fine picture indeed.  I''d have given you a big score and a gushing comment, Robert.  It''s such an unusual, clever photograph, and quite beautiful.  Other-worldly, in a quiet way.  A great thing to remember this special moment by.  Thank you.', '2012-02-14 14:07:44.000000', NULL, 0),
