(6676695, 997121, 61396, '<td valign="top">just noticed it. It''s pretty damn good, Rian. I like it a lot. (BTW, is this a new camera?)</td>', 'just noticed it. It''s pretty damn good, Rian. I like it a lot. (BTW, is this a new camera?)', '2012-02-14 17:20:07.000000', NULL, 0),
(6676697, 997094, 116649, '<td valign="top">Funny, I know I often put more into my title than the content deserves, but I can''t help but wonder if a different title wouldn''t have significantly altered the score on this one.  Of course I never thought it would even break 5, it was meant to be abstract, but the due date was SUPERBOWL SUNDAY, and I wanted to contrast the hype that went along with that national holiday.  Try to find an antonym for Hype.  Isn''t one really. So my title choices went from "Touchdown", do a simpler "T.D."(where I should have left it) to the current.  TD might have given a push to those who didn''t recognize the game immediately. Just glad it wasn''t the brown (not that I think it is a disgrace, just I didn''t think that this particular shot deserved one)</td>', 'Funny, I know I often put more into my title than the content deserves, but I can''t help but wonder if a different title wouldn''t have significantly altered the score on this one.  Of course I never thought it would even break 5, it was meant to be abstract, but the due date was SUPERBOWL SUNDAY, and I wanted to contrast the hype that went along with that national holiday.  Try to find an antonym for Hype.  Isn''t one really. So my title choices went from "Touchdown", do a simpler "T.D."(where I should have left it) to the current.  TD might have given a push to those who didn''t recognize the game immediately. Just glad it wasn''t the brown (not that I think it is a disgrace, just I didn''t think that this particular shot deserved one)', '2012-02-14 17:22:14.000000', NULL, 0),
(6676753, 996642, 30982, '<td valign="top">This is beautiful, Joe!</td>', 'This is beautiful, Joe!', '2012-02-14 18:36:31.000000', NULL, 0),
(6676817, 997050, 11769, '<td valign="top">Bravo! So glad this made it into the ribbons. Wonderful composition, the verticals and horizontals so powerful. The tiny lone skier in the immensity of nature. Even in the saddest of moments there is beauty to be seen.</td>', 'Bravo! So glad this made it into the ribbons. Wonderful composition, the verticals and horizontals so powerful. The tiny lone skier in the immensity of nature. Even in the saddest of moments there is beauty to be seen.', '2012-02-14 20:21:34.000000', NULL, 0),
